  "ruleText": "Auc 101.01 Purpose and Scope. The rules of this title implement the statutory responsibilities of the new hampshire board of auctioneers created by RSA 311-B:2.\n\nSource. #1993, eff 3-31-82; ss by #2706, eff 5-10-84; ss by #4093, eff 7-21-86; EXPIRED 7-21-92\n\nNew. #5441, eff 7-27-92; ss by #6657, eff 1-1-98; ss by #12155, eff 4-5-17",
